---
// Before/after retention design for personal data (illustrative).
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads (no marker ids).
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="erb">
  <div class="erb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after storage design. Left: raw records with no expiry lead to breach, sale in an acquisition, or subpoena. Right: dropping raw identifiers at ingestion, short TTLs and per-user keys leave little to take.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Keep everything, or keep only what the feature needs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ hết mọi thứ, hay chỉ giữ thứ tính năng cần</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Same signup form, two storage designs. Illustrative, not a measured result.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một form đăng ký, hai cách lưu trữ. Mang tính minh họa, không phải số đo.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="450" y1="60" x2="450" y2="330" class="divider" />
      <text x="20" y="82" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Keep everything</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ hết mọi thứ</tspan></text>
      <text x="470" y="82" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Minimize, expire, shred</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tối thiểu, hết hạn, hủy khóa</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="96" width="410" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="32" y="125" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Signup and every click</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đăng ký và mọi cú nhấp</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 225 144 L 225.0 166.0" /><polygon points="225,172 221.5,164.8 228.5,164.8" /></g>
      <rect x="20" y="172" width="410" height="64" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <text x="32" y="198" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Raw records with names and IDs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bản ghi thô kèm tên và giấy tờ</tspan></text>
      <text x="32" y="220" class="small"><tspan data-lang-en>No expiry date, no per-user key</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không hạn xóa, không khóa riêng từng người</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 90 236 L 90.0 256.0" /><polygon points="90,262 86.5,254.8 93.5,254.8" /></g>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 225 236 L 225.0 256.0" /><polygon points="225,262 221.5,254.8 228.5,254.8" /></g>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 360 236 L 360.0 256.0" /><polygon points="360,262 356.5,254.8 363.5,254.8" /></g>
      <rect x="20" y="262" width="130" height="44" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <text x="32" y="289" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Breach</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bị tấn công</tspan></text>
      <rect x="160" y="262" width="130" height="44" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <text x="172" y="289" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Sold on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bị bán lại</tspan></text>
      <rect x="300" y="262" width="130" height="44" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <text x="312" y="289" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Subpoena</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trát tòa</tspan></text>
      <rect x="470" y="96" width="410" height="48" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="482" y="125" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Signup and only the needed fields</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đăng ký và chỉ các trường cần</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 675 144 L 675.0 166.0" /><polygon points="675,172 671.5,164.8 678.5,164.8" /></g>
      <rect x="470" y="172" width="410" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="482" y="198" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Raw identifiers dropped at ingestion</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bỏ định danh thô ngay khi thu</tspan></text>
      <text x="482" y="220" class="small"><tspan data-lang-en>Short TTL on logs, one key per user</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>TTL ngắn cho log, mỗi người một khóa</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 675 236 L 675.0 256.0" /><polygon points="675,262 671.5,254.8 678.5,254.8" /></g>
      <rect x="470" y="262" width="410" height="44" rx="8" class="box dash" />
      <text x="482" y="289" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Delete the key or let TTL run: little to take</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hủy khóa hoặc để TTL chạy: còn ít để lấy</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The same data, two retention choices. Every row you keep is a row that a breach, a buyer or a court order can reach; a row you never stored cannot be.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một dữ liệu, hai lựa chọn lưu trữ. Mỗi dòng bạn giữ lại là một dòng mà vụ tấn công, người mua lại hay trát tòa có thể chạm tới; dòng chưa từng lưu thì không ai lấy được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .erb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .erb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .erb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .erb text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .erb .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .erb .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .erb .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .erb .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .erb .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .erb .bh { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .erb .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .erb .small { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .erb .note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .erb .redtxt { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .erb .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .erb .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .erb .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .erb .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .erb .cut { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .erb .divider { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .erb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
